KRDC 26.08.3: show the full-screen toolbar when full screen is entered.
The floating toolbar shows itself only from the main window's resize
event. A window that already has the size of the screen, as every
window in a gamescope panel has, is not resized by going full screen,
so the toolbar was created and never shown: no tab at the top edge to
point at, and no way out of full screen but the shortcut.

--- a/mainwindow.cpp
+++ b/mainwindow.cpp
@@ -906,6 +906,11 @@
 
         m_toolBar->addWidget(buttonBox);
     }
+
+    // The toolbar otherwise appears only when the window is resized,
+    // which entering full screen does not do to a window that already
+    // has the size of the screen.
+    m_toolBar->showAndAnimate();
 }
 
 void MainWindow::updateActionStatus()
